### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### Register a new user with bad data
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "geen-email",
  "password": "123"
}